<title>GERMANY: German Sept import prices +0.7 pct m/m,+0.3 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German Sept import prices +0.7 pct m/m,+0.3 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics</p>
<p>Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES	Sept 96     Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	   +0.7	  -0.2	 +0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	     +0.3	  -0.3	 +0.5</p>
<p>    Index (base 100 1991)  97.6	  96.9	 97.3</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	   +0.1	  -0.2	 +0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	     -0.5	  -0.5	 +2.0</p>
<p>    Index (base 100 1991) 103.3	 103.2	103.8</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
